{% macro render(skill) -%}
{%- set skill_cfg = config.skills[skill] -%}
{%- set agents = skill_cfg.get("agents", {}) -%}
{%- set hide_internal = skill_cfg.get("disable_internal_agents", False) -%}
{%- if agents -%}
## Available Agents

Always delegate to one of the agents listed below — never use any other agent
not on this list, and never do the work directly.

{% for agent, spec in agents.items() %}
{%- if not (hide_internal and spec.get("internal", False)) %}
### `{{ agent }}`

{% if spec.get("type", "agent") == "agent" -%}
Invoke via the `Agent` tool with `subagent_type="{{ agent }}"`. Pass the briefing in the `prompt` arg.
{%- else -%}
Invoke via the `Bash` tool: pipe the briefing on stdin to `booping run-agent {{ agent }}`. For commands that may run more than a few seconds, use `run_in_background: true` and poll `BashOutput` instead of blocking the foreground.
{%- endif %}

{% if spec.good_for %}
**Good for:**
{% for t in spec.good_for -%}
- {{ t }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif -%}
{% if spec.bad_for %}
**Bad for:**
{% for t in spec.bad_for -%}
- {{ t }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{%- endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
